'''Masked Grandmaster Cat''' (仮面のネコ仙人, ''Kamen no Neko Sennin'', '''Masked Cat Hermit''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Hermit Cat (Enemy)|Hermit Cat]] introduced on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] of the [[Infernal Tower]], which unlocks him as [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Hermit Cat]]'s [[True Form]] via [[Catnip Challenges]] when completed. He was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

