==Enemy==
Masked Grandmaster Cat himself is essentially the same as Hermit Cat, just with more damage, the Relic trait, and a guaranteed chance to inflict curse. Overall, the only thing making him much more challenging is that instead of having [[Trolly Blogger]]s to make him miss, he's supported by [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s and [[Sinner Snache]]s.

