==Trivia==
*His greatly resembles that of [[wikia:dragonball:Grandpa Gohan|Grandpa Gohan]] from the ''Dragon Ball'' series.
*Similar to [[Hermit Cat (Enemy)|Hermit Cat]], his staff bears resemblance to the top of the [[Infernal Tower]], having the same design.
*His design combines both of the previous forms of his [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|allied self]], having the Normal Form's head shape and Evolved Form's beard.
*He and [[Zero Luza]] are tied for the fourth highest health out of all [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]], only being beaten by [[Iguanidae Ibilujon]], [[Esoteric Uril (Enemy)|Esoteric Uril]], and [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]].
*He, [[Spiritual Yulala (Enemy)|Spiritual Yulala]], and [[Esoteric Uril (Enemy)|Esoteric Uril]] are currently the only Relic enemies without descriptions.
**Incidentally, all of these enemies are exclusive to the [[Infernal Tower]] and fought to unlock the [[True Form]]s of their corresponding [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]].

